index 0000000..97e6f38
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/api/sections/activities.md
@@ -0,0 +1,80 @@
+# Activities
+
+Account activity is the stream of events shown on the HTML timeline: cards being published, assigned, moved, closed, commented on, and so on.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity the current user can access, newest first.
+
+The following event actions are included:
+
+- `card_assigned`
+- `card_unassigned`
+- `card_published`
+- `card_closed`
+- `card_reopened`
+- `card_board_changed`
+- `card_postponed`
+- `card_auto_postponed`
+- `card_triaged`
+- `card_sent_back_to_triage`
+- `comment_created`
+- `card_title_changed`
+
+Deprecated `card_collection_changed` events are omitted.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator ID(s) |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+    "action": "card_published",
+    "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:03:58.000Z",
+    "description": "David added \"First!\"",
+    "particulars": {},
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 1,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`eventable`, `board`, and `creator` use the same representations as the Cards, Boards, and Users endpoints. For comment events, `eventable` is a comment and `eventable_type` is `Comment`.
+
+`description` is the plain-text form of the event. For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, it opens the card where the comment was posted and jumps to that comment.
+
+The `particulars` object exposes event-specific details:
+
+- assignment changes (`card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`) contain `assignee_ids`
+- board changes (`card_board_changed`) contain `old_board` and `new_board`
+- title changes (`card_title_changed`) contain `old_title` and `new_title`
+- triage events (`card_triaged`) contain `column`
+
+Other events return an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..59bbba9
